# The journal IS the account: positions, cash, drawdown state, every decision
# the model ever made and its API responses. It is state, not source, and it
# does not belong in git.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing: `data/` unanchored also matches
# `claude_trader/data/`, which is the package's market-data layer. It silently
# excluded five source files from the repository -- everything passed locally
# and every clone was unimportable. Anchor every directory rule here.
/data/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# Generated by the publish steps
/public/
